<title>UK: Tomkins shares up, SBC Warburg rates &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Tomkins shares up, SBC Warburg rates &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Tomkins Plc climbed on Wednesday after analysts at SBC Warburg upgraded their recommendation on the British baking-to-engineering conglomerate to &quot;add&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1010 GMT Tomkins shares were 4-1/2p higher at 285.</p>
<p>Analysts at SBC Warburg were not immediately available for comment but market sources confirmed they had upgraded the stock.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
